  "title": "epan: Use ms/us/ns when displaying a rel time in days/hours/minutes/secs",
  "description": "When displaying a relative time as a human-readable string using\ndays/hours/minutes/secs, use milliseconds, microseconds, and\nnanoseconds as appropriate if the number of seconds is zero.\n\nRelated to #11727, #19966 (though this function is not used for\nputting relative times in the proto tree currently, as this\ndisplay format isn't an option.)",
